From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:24:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(03-24): add failing tests for the unified ai-to-rag
 write path

- unified branch calls ingest() with the session scope, chat/message source key and metadata
- refused cases (no session, foreign body userId, non-member organization) never reach ingest
- caller document metadata is persisted by ingest and cannot overwrite pipeline-owned keys

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X342shLsAZx6PYph2vA7hc
